      "id": 5879,
      "name": "Season 1",
      "overview": "The three Halliwell sisters discover that they are descendents of a line of female witches. Each has a special ability (stopping time, moving objects, seeing the future), and they can also combine their abilities into the \u0022Power of Three\u0022 to fight demons, warlocks, and other evils.",
